WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Welcome to our video on the Sustainability Solutions Hub in Seller Central.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.267
In this guide, we'll walk you through the Sustainability Solutions Hub, a comprehensive resource

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.000
for Amazon Sustainability Programs.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Start by accessing Seller Central.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Click on Growth, then Explore Programs, and scroll to select Sustainability.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.500
You can also access the hub by visiting sellercentral.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.000
amazon.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
com/sustainability.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The hub serves as your gateway to Amazon's array of Sustainability Initiatives.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
You'll find detailed information on programs such as the Climate Pledge Friendly Program,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
resources such as the Service Provider Network, and insights into the Climate Pledge itself.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.158
The hub offers an overview of each program, outlining benefits, costs, how it works, and steps for

00:00:52.158 --> 00:00:53.000
getting started.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
It also provides general information on renewable energy.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.000
In addition to sharing information about sustainability programs,

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.105
the hub also introduces new tools like reporting dashboards and a new sustainability category in

00:01:08.105 --> 00:01:10.000
the Service Provider Network.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.750
Let's explore the reporting dashboards.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:19.900
These tools assist in monitoring your progress, analyzing program performance and identifying products

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:21.000
for enrollment.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
They offer a comprehensive view of key performance indicators for the programs you're part of.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Let's dive into the CPF dashboard as an example.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.579
It offers a performance summary with monthly and quarterly views of key metrics and revenue distribution

00:01:37.579 --> 00:01:39.000
over CPF certifications.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.667
If you scroll down further on the page, you'll find a section listing your potential CPF candidate

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:45.000
products,

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:52.000
which are likely to hold a CPF qualifying certification, but do not yet hold the CPF badge.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.545
Further down, you will find your top-selling products without the CPF badge, where we recommend

00:01:58.545 --> 00:02:01.000
looking for opportunities to certify products.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:07.000
To correctly badge products, please follow the guidelines in the CPF Product Submission Template,

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:13.611
which you can find on the blue link displayed on the Sustainability Solutions Hub page on Seller

00:02:13.611 --> 00:02:14.000
Central.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.588
The latest snapshot section provides a list of your CPF-badged products on the latest available

00:02:20.588 --> 00:02:21.000
date,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:25.000
as well as the trailing 12-month revenue of these ASINs.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:31.609
Each dashboard is updated monthly, ensuring you have the latest data by the 15th of each month to

00:02:31.609 --> 00:02:33.000
guide your sustainability decisions.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.000
Finally, let's focus on the Sustainability category within the Service Provider Network.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:45.737
You can access the Service Provider Network on Seller Central by selecting Apps and Services and

00:02:45.737 --> 00:02:47.000
then Explore Services.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:52.727
You can also access this directly through the Sustainability Solutions Hub by selecting Sustainability

00:02:52.727 --> 00:02:56.000
on the drop-down menu on the right.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:02.000
This section offers a hand-picked selection of third-party sustainability service providers,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:07.000
assisting with packaging design and testing and product design and certification.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Filter options, refine providers by service type or program.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:17.588
Visit the Sustainability Solutions Hub in Seller Central and explore how you can support a sustainable

00:03:17.588 --> 00:03:18.000
world.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:22.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store!
